{"id":"ab547445abec5a1c","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-zfc-tree9-branch-space.md","title":"ZFC Tree9 Branch Space","display":"df-zfc-tree9-branch-space — ZFC Tree9 Branch Space","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-tree9-branch-space","aliases":["58-df-zfc-tree9-branch-space"],"display":"df-zfc-tree9-branch-space — ZFC Tree9 Branch Space","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order]]","[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-tree8-branch-through-tree]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-tree9-branch-space"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-tree9-branch-space</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-tree9-branch-space — ZFC Tree9 Branch Space"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d25b709595952a78\" href=\"?note=d25b709595952a78\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order\">../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c1e64933d6b4128f\" href=\"?note=c1e64933d6b4128f\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-tree8-branch-through-tree\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-tree8-branch-through-tree</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B,T,\\leq_T\\in V\">\\(B,T,\\leq_T\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8BranchThroughTree}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree8BranchThroughTree}_S\\)</span> are the registered tree-order and maximal-branch predicates.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree9BranchSpace}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree9BranchSpace}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree9\\text{-}branch\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree9BranchSpace}_S(B,T,\\leq_T)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S(T,\\leq_T)\n\\land\nB=\\{b\\in\\mathcal P(T):\\mathrm{ZfcTree8BranchThroughTree}_S(b,T,\\leq_T)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree9\\text{-}branch\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree9BranchSpace}_S(B,T,\\leq_T)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S(T,\\leq_T)\n\\land\nB=\\{b\\in\\mathcal P(T):\\mathrm{ZfcTree8BranchThroughTree}_S(b,T,\\leq_T)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This atom defines the set-valued carrier of the branch space. A topology on that carrier must be supplied separately rather than being hidden in an untyped unary operator.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order","status":"resolved","id":"d25b709595952a78","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-tree8-branch-through-tree","status":"resolved","id":"c1e64933d6b4128f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-tree8-branch-through-tree]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"B,T,\\leq_T\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8BranchThroughTree}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree9BranchSpace}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree9\\text{-}branch\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree9BranchSpace}_S(B,T,\\leq_T)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S(T,\\leq_T)\n\\land\nB=\\{b\\in\\mathcal P(T):\\mathrm{ZfcTree8BranchThroughTree}_S(b,T,\\leq_T)\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1083,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3827","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-tree9-branch-space.md|58-df-zfc-tree9-branch-space]]（batch14）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","d25b709595952a78","c1e64933d6b4128f"]}